# Redirect HTTP to HTTPS and non-www to www
http://asecureannapolislocksmith.com/* https://www.asecureannapolislocksmith.com/:splat 301!
http://www.asecureannapolislocksmith.com/* https://www.asecureannapolislocksmith.com/:splat 301!
https://asecureannapolislocksmith.com/* https://www.asecureannapolislocksmith.com/:splat 301!

# Canonical redirect: /locations/annapolis -> homepage (same content)
